 "notes": "OFR-32 (Kite 1983): Seivern 15-minute quadrangle as four 7.5-minute map plates (Seivern, Wagener, Kitchings Mill, Salley) and a section plate. The plates in this packet carry no explanation of map units; unit symbols are recorded only as labels on the section and flagged inferred. Drill-hole labels on the map faces are queued for an image re-read. SUBSURFACE: section A-A' interpretive.\nRe-read of pages 1-4 (the four 7.5-minute plates of the Seivern 15' quadrangle) for SCGS drill-hole labels, read on 72 dpi tiles. Holes are numbered 2-xx (Aiken), 32-xx (Lexington) and 38-xx (Orangeburg). These pages held no earlier values.",
